    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "A stranger sees me sitting next to my bicycle using my tablet and comes back shortly offering a Bible. I explain my choice of the electronic version but he insists I take his Bible and redistribute it if I must, whereupon he also offers me 20 dollars. Notice his message affixed to the cover. Fortunately, for the most part, I've already done that. \n\nA day earlier a woman gave me 200 dollars and an iPhone 6.\n\nIn addition,  the United States government has allotted me 3200 dollars to support their phony fiat money scheme. \n\nPeople are very loose with their money. Beggars along the sides of roads at shopping center intersections are having a field day.",
